[12022]="70069839\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Derrota a Belondor y su tripulación\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAfter escaping the Citadel of winds, Azagath Sea-shadow, Belondor, and Nakási Wave-reaper entered the Mâkhda Khorbo. You pursued them into the temple of ash and blood and now scour the depths for the trio.\n",
[12023]="7006A150\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Derrota a Belondor y su tripulación\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAfter escaping the Citadel of winds, Azagath Sea-shadow, Belondor, and Nakási Wave-reaper entered the Mâkhda Khorbo. You pursued them into the temple of ash and blood and now scour the depths for the trio.\n",
[12024]="7006A14F\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Derrota a Belondor y su tripulación\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAzagath's personal guard, bolstered by a fell-shade of the man, bar the entrance to the smuggler's cover beneath Mâkhda Khorbo. Their orders are to slaughter any interlopers.\n",
