[12027]="70021E81\n1\tRecolecta bayas silvestres en la Arboleda Lóbrega (total: 12)\tSe pueden encontrar bayas a lo largo de los senderos de la Arboleda Lóbrega. Umfrë te sugiere recolectar bayas como ofrenda para los Derudh de la Arboleda Lóbrega antes de acercarte a ellos.\n2\tLleva las bayas al Derudh en Galar Culch.\tLos Derudh de la Arboleda Lóbrega se encuentran en un círculo de piedras llamado Galar Culch, al sur de Echad Daervunn. Umfrë te dijo que te acercaras a los Derudh con una ofrenda de bayas.\n3\tHabla con Enit en Galar Culch\tEnit está en Galar Culch, al sur de Echad Daervunn. Puede que Enit la Derudh conozca una ruta a las Tierras Brunas a través de la Arboleda Lóbrega.\n",
[12028]="70027F4D\n1\tDerrota al Devorador\tEl Devorador habita en algún lugar de las minas de los orcos. Meriun te pidió que encuentres y mates al Devorador, un enorme gusano del foso que acecha a los esclavos desprevenidos en la mina.\n2\tHabla con Meriun en las minas de los orcos\tMeriun está en las minas de los orcos. Debes volver y decirle a Meriun que has matado al Devorador.\n",
[12029]="70048C69\n1\tCollect medical supplies (total: 3)\tThe stolen medical supplies are hidden in Viznak's hideout. You should find and collect the medical supplies.\n2\tAttempt to heal Rhadrog with Maiden's Helm\tRhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's hideout. You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.\n3\tAttempt to heal Rhadrog with Wanderbeard\tRhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's Hideout. You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.\n4\tAttempt to heal Rhadrog with Kingsfoil\tRhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's hideout. You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.\n5\tHabla con Faeron\tFaeron can be found at Viznak's hideout. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[12030]="7006BF75\n1\tGather discarded cloth in Urmâkh for stray dogs (total: 8)\030Gather loose rope in Urmâkh for stray dogs (total: 6)\tBarûl has asked for your help in collecting discarded cloth to treat wounds and loose rope for leashes for the stray dogs of Urmâkh. You can find discarded cloth and loose rope around Urmâkh.\n2\tReturn to Barûl in Urmâkh with the items you've found\tReturn to Barûl in Urmâkh with the cloth and rope you have collected.\n",
[12031]="7006BF6D\n1\tSpeak with Agiti about the vanished dogs\030Speak with Sûdakh about the vanished dogs\030Speak with Ghemûna about the vanished dogs\tSpeak with Urmâkh villagers to learn more about the vanishing of Urmâkh's dogs.\n2\tCheck the southern edge of Urmâkh for signs of dogs\030Check the north-eastern corner of Urmâkh for signs of dogs\030Check near the blacksmith's forge for signs of dogs\tCheck the rumoured dog locations to see if any clues or dogs reside there.\n3\tReturn to speak with Urdush\tReturn to speak with Urdush.\n",
[12032]="7006BF6C\n1\tSpeak with Niriga in Urmâkh\tSpeak with Niriga in Urmâkh to determine the best course of action.\n2\tSpeak with Sûdakh in Urmâkh\030Speak with Ghemûna in Urmâkh\tSpeak with Sûdakh and Ghemûna in Urmâkh.\n3\tSpeak with Niriga when you are ready to go\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh with what you have learned.\n4\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh and tell her what happened in Shakhdag.\n",
})
